<section xml:id="sec-central-tendency">
    <title>Central Tendency</title>
    <p>
        The mean of <m>n</m> values is
        <m>\bar{x} = \frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i</m>.
    </p>
    <program language="r">
        <code><![CDATA[mean(sleep_hours)]]></code>
    </program>
    <program>
        <code><![CDATA[## [1] 6.6]]></code>
    </program>
    <p>
        The median is the middle value once the data are sorted.
    </p>
</section>
